    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あんたの記事は、もう君咲学院のいちぶなんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「いつだって、あたしたちは待ち望んでる。あたしも、みんなも。それだけ伝えさせてほしい、何度だって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あんたが、あたしに青春っていう物語をくれたんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「立てよ。ちいさくてか弱い、けど偉大な作者さんよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「深鳥さんの言うとおりだよ、胸を張って堂々としてろよ。あんたはけっこう、『たいしたやつ』なんだからさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「ひとりで立てないなら、あたしが支えてやんよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あんたが憧れてくれた『正義の味方』にはさ、その程度のこと造作もね～んだぜ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「だから、お願い。俯かないで、泣かないでくれよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「『あたしたち』はずっと、いつだって、あんたの新作を待ち望んでるんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あたしたちを書いてくれよ、もっともっと。深鳥さんは卒業しちまう、他の三年生のみんなも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「でもあんたが書き留めたら、それは永遠になる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 53,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 486
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「あんたにはそれができる、なのにさぁ……。そうやってウジウジして、いつまでも泣きべそかいて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はやて",
    "text": "「『自分には何もできない』みたいな、辛気くさい顔してんのかよ？」"
